{"municipality_code":"08220","pref":"茨城県","city":"つくば市","headline":"村の境界の痕跡があるかもしれません。貴重な土木遺産もあります。","display_comment_enriched":"つくば市には、江戸期の谷田部藩と谷田部藩陣屋跡に連なる領主・城下の記憶が残っています。 周辺には寺社や信仰の場、城跡や陣屋跡、古墳や貝塚にまつわる場所が点在し、「金田城跡」、「小田城跡」、「多気城跡」などを起点に歩くと、地域の歴史がぐっと見えやすくなります。 現地では城跡・陣屋跡、史跡説明板が、地域の歴史を読み解く手がかりになるでしょう。 さらに谷田部藩にゆかりのある領主碑や旧領境のしるべも、現地で探してみたい歴史の手がかりです。 ゆかりの人物では久松静児や飯塚伊賀七に注目すると、地域に残る文化や時代背景をさらに深く知るきっかけになります。 「筑波山」や「筑波山梅まつり」などの名所も、地域の物語を深掘りする絶好の入口です。","radar_groups":[{"id":"town","title":"街の基盤","metrics":[{"id":"dining","label":"飲食店","short_label":"飲食","count":23,"rank":1118,"percentile":40.1,"national_average":234.0,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"parks","label":"公園・遊具","short_label":"公園","count":96,"rank":219,"percentile":88.3,"national_average":35.1,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"public","label":"公共施設","short_label":"公共","count":63,"rank":323,"percentile":82.6,"national_average":39.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"culture","label":"文化施設","short_label":"文化","count":34,"rank":93,"percentile":94.7,"national_average":12.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"landscape","label":"景観・樹木","short_label":"景観","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":0.2,"municipality_total":1896}]},{"id":"history","title":"歴史資産","metrics":[{"id":"temples_shrines","label":"寺社仏閣","short_label":"寺社","count":27,"rank":139,"percentile":92.4,"national_average":8.9,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"historic_sites","label":"史跡・遺跡","short_label":"史跡","count":13,"rank":329,"percentile":80.7,"national_average":7.8,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"roads_posts","label":"街道・宿場","short_label":"街道","count":0,"rank":null,"percentile":0.0,"national_average":1.2,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"villages","label":"近世村","short_label":"近世村","count":153,"rank":53,"percentile":97.3,"national_average":31.5,"municipality_total":1896},{"id":"civil","label":"土木遺産","short_label":"土木","count":2,"rank":33,"percentile":94.7,"national_average":0.3,"municipality_total":1896}]}],"culture_cards":{"notable_peopl